{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0000170 sphingosine hydroxylase activity\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29717.\n(to be replaced by the same and better defined GO:0102772 sphingolipid C4-monooxygenase activity)\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1z1hE5t7jUy8HFdspQLOwJSGuHYhaa4g44hRRv-c-FVo/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nGR 1\nMGI 2 (autotransfer)\n~PomBase 2~ DONE\nReactome 1\nSGD 2 (autotransfer)\nTAIR 2\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nreactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-428260 > GO:sphingosine hydroxylase activity ; GO:0000170\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-02-21T22:50:46Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0000170 sphingosine hydroxylase activity (with replacement)", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-02-24T00:36:51Z"}
